<span class=\"v-m\">否定；否认；否定的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">打ち込む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うちこむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">钉入；打入；击打；挥打；扣杀；射入；发射；输入；录入；专心从事；沉迷于；热衷于；全力投入；练习击球；击中；打到对手；侵入对手领地；在对手棋形中放置棋子；灌入；浇筑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112846\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把这份工作投入了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">団扇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うちわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">团扇；圆扇（日本传统手持扇子）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76567\">ちなみに、この<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>冷房設備<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぼうせつび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なんて<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。あるのはうちわだけ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">另外，这间房里面没有冷气设备之类的东西，有的只是一把团扇。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1941168\" title=\"Tatoeba · fercheung\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fercheung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">内訳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うちわけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">(费用等的)明细；项目；分类；详细情况</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123214\"><ruby>内訳<rp>(</rp><rt>うちわけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどのようにしましょう？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如何进行内部翻译?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">訴え</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うったえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">诉讼；投诉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220719\">この<ruby>訴<rp>(</rp><rt>うった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えを<ruby>退<rp>(</rp><rt>しりぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けたくはない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不想放弃这项诉讼。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">鬱陶しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うっとうしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">阴郁的；沉闷的；烦人的；恼人的；阴沉的；沉闷的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81316\"><ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うっとうしくていやですね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每一天都很开心,好吧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">写し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">副本；复制本；誊本；抄送；抄送副本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209621\">その<ruby>写<rp>(</rp><rt>うつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しは<ruby>原本<rp>(</rp><rt>げんぽん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">图片与原文相匹配。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">空ろ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">空洞；腔体；虚空；空洞的；呆滞的；茫然的；空泛的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">器</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">碗；器皿；容器；能力；才能；器量</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76868\">いくら<ruby>器<rp>(</rp><rt>うつわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけを<ruby>日本一<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんいち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしても、<ruby>中身<rp>(</rp><rt>なかみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>三流<rp>(</rp><rt>さんりゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やったらな～んの<ruby>意味<rp>(</rp><rt>いみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もないんちゃうの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">无论你在日本做多少个装置,如果你的内身是三流的,那就没什么意义了吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雨天</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雨天；阴雨天气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189518\"><ruby>雨天<rp>(</rp><rt>うてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>晴天<rp>(</rp><rt>せいてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">风暴过后，太阳出来了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/7768231\" title=\"Tatoeba · jiangche\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · jiangche\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">腕前</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うでまえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">能力；技能；本领</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160381\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのゴルファーの<ruby>腕前<rp>(</rp><rt>うでまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>驚<rp>(</rp><rt>おどろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在高尔夫球员的手中感到惊讶。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:促す\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">促す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うながす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">促使；催促</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>患者<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>注意<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>促<rp>(</rp><rt>うなが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">医生提醒患者注意。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自惚れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うぬぼれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span>