ref=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">梅干；腌梅；盐渍梅干</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">末</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">顶端；尖端</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">裏返し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うらがえし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">里外翻转；翻个面；倒转；反面；对立面；相反；背面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224255\">ここへ<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>途中<rp>(</rp><rt>とちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>かぜ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>強<rp>(</rp><rt>つよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すぎて<ruby>僕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>傘<rp>(</rp><rt>かさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>裏返<rp>(</rp><rt>うらがえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しになってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">走到这里的时候,风太强大了,我的伞已经转过身来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り出し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりだし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特价销售；大减价；促销</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231302\">あのデパートでは<ruby>今週<rp>(</rp><rt>こんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>メンズスーツが<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这家公寓本周将出售男士服装。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">推向市场；推出销售；开始销售；上市销售；走红；变得受欢迎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225461\">クリスマスは<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいおもちゃを<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すいい<ruby>機会<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">圣诞节是出售新玩具的好机会。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">潤う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うるおう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变得湿润；被润湿；变得潮湿；受湿；获利；受益；变得繁荣；兴旺；致富；（心灵）得到滋润；（精神）得到充实</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">五月蝿い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うるさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">吵闹；嘈杂；烦人；麻烦；令人厌烦；纠缠不休；挑剔；讲究；爱挑剔；爱唠叨；严格要求；闭嘴；安静点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230966\">あの<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はなんてうるさい<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她是多么可怕的孩子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">浮気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うわき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">婚外情；出轨；不正当关系；不忠；朝三暮四；见异思迁；反复无常；水性杨花</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"107842\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>浮気<rp>(</rp><rt>うわき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他从来没有欺骗过。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">上手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うわて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">上部；上方；上游；河流上游；舞台右侧（观众视角）；舞台左侧（演员视角）；（比较时）更高明；技高一筹；本领更强；（相扑）上手（从对方手臂外侧抓住其腰带的握法）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">上回る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うわまわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">超过（尤指数字、利润、失业率等）；超越；超出；胜过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147489\"><ruby>所得税<rp>(</rp><rt>しょとくぜい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>控除額<rp>(</rp><rt>こうじょがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>上回<rp>(</rp><rt>うわまわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るいかなる<ruby>所得<rp>(</rp><rt>しょとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもかかる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所得税将超越折扣金额的任何收入。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">植わる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うわる</span></div><div c